  "id": "dsh-mobile-layout",
  "name": "移动端与远程访问（DSH Mobile Layout）",
  "packageName": "@xiaopb/dsh-mobile-layout",
  "description": "为 DSH 提供移动端与远程访问能力。英文原始说明：DSH web-UI plugin: phone-portrait layout shell. Keeps the official AppFrame untouched on desktop, and on phone portrait switches the sidebar to an off-canvas drawer, adds a 56px persistent action bar under the composer (new / sessions / files / images / plugins / more), keeps permission and model controls in the composer row, and folds the header tools into a compact corner. All overrides are scoped to html[data-dshm-mode=\"mobile\"] and fall back to the official layout when anchors are missing.",
